THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES
====================

Every Rust crate linked into the lotel binary, with the license each is
shipped under and its full text. lotel itself (Apache-2.0, whose full text
is in LICENSE) appears in this list for completeness.

Generated from Cargo.lock by `cargo about generate about.hbs` using
about.toml — scripts/dist.sh regenerates it on every `just dist`, so it can
never drift from the shipped binary. Do not edit by hand.

Non-crate components (DuckDB, the otlp/fts extensions, fonts, uPlot) are
listed in NOTICE; the DuckDB/otlp MIT texts are under licenses/.

